<title>USA: EP Medsystems sees disappointing Q2.</title>
<headline>EP Medsystems sees disappointing Q2.</headline>
<dateline>BUDD LAKE, N.J. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>EP MedSystems Inc said Monday its net loss for the second quarter will exceed analysts' estimates.</p>
<p>The company, which develops, markets, sells and services cardiac electrophysiology products, also said its second quarter sales will fall short of analysts' estimates.</p>
</text>
